{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：20:20 2026-11-13 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"石門大涌橋路住宅地推招標 市場估值逾18億\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c5a5c1497361ea5ea9774c466d18581e/2026-11/KF_Christine_28_.png\"/>\n<p>沙田住宅地新供應陸續推出，地政總署公布推出沙田石門大涌橋路與安心街交界住宅地招標，鄰近翠湖花園、碧濤花園，地盤面積約8.6萬方呎，涉及可建總樓面約53.5萬方呎，料提供約890伙，將於下月18日截標。綜合市場估值約18.71億至22.96億，每呎樓面估值約4400至5400元。</p>\n<img alt=\"沙田石門大涌橋路與安心街交界住宅地推出招標。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cce0fdcf5b22db7245d2010ed3d090a0/2026-11/PW261015ST010.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/29435c32db1d17847f88bf7f026bcbc8/2026-11/PW261015ST002.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ba5199370729de51a789a7df12787d1e/2026-11/PF260815BB07.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/74ebfd83530a28b2d1948a5c235ec414/2026-11/PF260815BB01.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ce6fd2173d871f16f5c80b2b80d53fed/2026-11/PF260815BB03.jpg\"/>\n<p>事實上，政府近2年已成功批出3幅沙田住宅地，對上一幅為沙田大圍美田路（沙田市地段第651號）住宅地，去年1月由新地以6.06億中標，當時每呎樓面地價約3128元。</p>\n<p>相關文章：賣地計劃政府今季推沙田石門住宅地 涉960伙 首3季提供約156萬伙超全年目標</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T02:18:03.203927+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":292,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T01:56:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T09:36:38.711962+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T02:11:19.971656+00:00","content_hash":"4ca6dbd17ddadc0fbc128a677cc3732170cd08642d1f822d325042ade649d215","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}